V7 has just dropped V Orange, expanding its portfolio into one of the market’s leading soda flavors. Made with 100% natural flavors, enriched with Vitamin D, caffeine-free, free from artificial colors, and containing less than 100 kcal per serving, V Orange brings a familiar favorite to consumers with the benefits that define V’s range,  making it a new choice made to earn moms’ approval.

The launch marks another milestone in V7’s expanding portfolio and growing international presence, further completing its flavor range as the brand continues to bring its evolving product offering to more consumers across markets.

